| File | Change |
|---|---|
| `src/api/vector.hpp` | NEW. Contract comment and `register_vector(lua_State*)` |
| `src/api/vector.cpp` | NEW. `kp.vec` constructor (`vector.cpp:91`), operators, methods, `register_vector` (`vector.cpp:288`) |
