### Red: regressions written first, fixes not yet applied

`kp_supporttest`: rc=1, 45 ok, 3 FAIL.
```
PANIC: unprotected error in call to Lua API (strict: undefined global no_such_global)
    child: exited=1 status=1 signalled=0
